# Build mode for the Playwright suite. The e2e tests drive the app end to end
# against local fixture data, which requires demo mode — and demo mode is
# defined as "no usable OAuth client id" (see isDemoMode in src/app/boot.ts).
#
# Blanking the id here pins that explicitly. Until this file existed the suite
# merely inherited an empty .env, so committing a real client id silently
# booted the preview into the OAuth login screen and every test failed on a
# missing fixture. Demo mode is a requirement of these tests, not an accident
# of what .env happens to hold.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
